					<font fontName="SansSerif" size="10" isBold="false"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[      I hereby acknowledge to have received the following tools & equipment  for which will be used solely in the service of NORECO I.  It is understood that I will be responsible for the proper handling of these equipments.]]></text>
